<title>UK: OKB sets 100 million stg three-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>OKB sets 100 million stg three-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE KONTROLLBANK</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  AUSTRIA, REPUBLIC OF</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    27.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.2385   PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    97.051    SPREAD	+4 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
